name: police_handset_network
description: "Handset network over time - the calls of every number with 6 or more call partners, the people those numbers are attributed to and where they live (police_call_links_dataset). Play the time range Mar-Jul 2026: five controller numbers take over from one another every 3-5 weeks, each called by about 35 customers, at least 70 percent carried over, all calling the same four runner numbers; the runners ring three lone, vulnerable residents (drug bases at vulnerable residents' addresses). Run Link prediction from a controller to find the next one. A delivery driver's number (208 contacts, each called once to three times) and a busy shared house never touch the network."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: police_call_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[3]: ts,amount,via
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
